        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55211, Solid Brass Door Eye Viewer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door viewer is used for both security and privacy. It is handy when you have a solid door with no windows, so you can see who is at your doorway before opening the door. This simple and inexpensive product can add a whole lot of security and peace of mind to your home. This door peep hole has a 200 degree wide viewing angle and is UL Listed for use on fire rated doors. Fits metal and wood doors 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\" thick. Solid brass construction. Installation is easy: the viewer is two piece. Drill a 5/8\" diameter hole in the door. Insert one piece on the inside, and screw in the second piece from the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Compatible <a href=\"/products/viewer-cover-for-55211-ul-viewer-deltana-552cover\">Interior Peep Hole Cover</a></b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-55211-size.gif?v=1704354503\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55211 Eye Viewer Size\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 55211 Eye Viewer:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\" (35mm - 57mm)</li>\r\n<li>Hole Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>200 Degree Viewing</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Extension: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Shaft Diameter: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Lens</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3KTN</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/55211.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55211 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i> <b>ADD a <a href=\"/products/viewer-cover-for-55211-ul-viewer-deltana-552cover\">Viewer Cover </a></b> for even more security!\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Door Security Glass Eye Viewer 200 Degree, Deltana 55211",
                "description": "Deltana 55211 Door Eye Viewer - This door viewer is used for both security and privacy. It is handy when you have a solid door with no windows, so you can see who is at your doorway before opening the door. This simple and inexpensive product can add a whole lot of security and peace of mind to your home. This door peep hole has a 200 degree wide viewing angle. Fits metal and wood doors 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\" thick. Available in 8 different finishes. Solid brass construction. Installation is easy: the viewer is two piece. Drill a 5/8\" diameter hole in the door. Insert one piece on the inside, and screw in the second piece from the outside.\r\n",
